{
  "_readme": [
    "Expected output of every example in the released examples archive.",
    "scripts/release_helpers.py package-examples copies these apps into the archive's spec.json,",
    "adding the release and its bundle URL; scripts/test_examples_archive.py runs that exact",
    "archive before publication, and roc-automation's nightly compatibility workflow runs the",
    "published one against each new Roc nightly. Each case runs from the archive root, compares",
    "stdout, stderr and the exit code exactly, and must finish within ten seconds."
